  "title": "Pecan Coconut Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "Thick and chewy pecan-coconut-chocolate cookies have white and semisweet chips, flaked coconut, and crunchy pecans. Coconut extract boosts the flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Bake4fun"
